  "description": "CR 709.5d, 709.5e, 709.5h, 305.1, 601.3, 614.1a, 611.2a: Walk-In Closet lets its controller play lands from their graveyard; unlocking Forgotten Cellar lets them cast spells from it that turn and exiles any card that would go to their graveyard that turn",
  "note": "Before the Closet, the Forest in alice's graveyard can't be played; after it, it can, but Giant Growth there can't be cast. Unlocking Forgotten Cellar lets her cast that Giant Growth, which is exiled as it resolves, while bob's Lightning Bolt at her end step at alice goes to bob's graveyard. On bob's turn the turn's permission and replacement have ended: bob's Shock sends Savannah Lions to her graveyard, and the second Giant Growth can't be cast.",
